            <li><strong>Stakeholder Representations:</strong> The Commission solicits detailed memorandums and oral testimonies from union confederations, defence leadership, and administrative services.</li>
            <li><strong>Report Compilation & Submission:</strong> The Commission synthesizes historical economic data, fiscal constraints, and price indices into a comprehensive final report.</li>
            <li><strong>Empowered Committee of Secretaries (E-CoS):</strong> An empowered panel headed by the Cabinet Secretary analyzes the fiscal viability of the proposals.</li>
            <li><strong>Union Cabinet Approval & Gazette Notification:</strong> The Cabinet formally adopts the modified recommendations, notifying the new pay rules in the Gazette of India.</li>
